  "description": "Lee Ju-Yeong (female, 30), whose behavior is unpredictable, is a lifelong single and a staunch advocate of non-romance. Yet, she receives a proposal to work on an adult romance webtoon.\n\n *'But how on earth do you draw sex and dating?!'*\n\nDesperate to gain sexual creative inspiration, she abruptly proposes a one-night stand to her upstairs friend, Lee Do-Yeong (male, 30)?! Do-yeong is a devoted man who has harbored a crush on Ju-Yeong for a long time, and he is at a loss as she relentlessly strips off his pants.\n\n *\"Hey, Lee Ju-Yeong, snap out of it.\"\n\n\"Can't you just... do it just once? I... I want to sleep with a guy...\"* \n\nWill Lee Do-Yeong's innocence be able to survive against this bulldozer-like Lee Ju-Yeong?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
